    "idIdentity": "IDs are compared as exact uint32 bits (floatBitsToUint); the host upload carries the source float bits unchanged",
    "cpuFallback": "an invalid geometry, a device-limit or budget refusal, a foreign device, or a wrong thread fails closed with an explicit diagnostic; no silent CPU substitution"
